{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set sail across a vast, dark world </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an rpg adventure of a lifetime in an Alice-in-Wonderland-esque inspired world, discovering islands and cutting your way through the shadows.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture out into the darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover an island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See what supplies they need. Sell them  goods. Start a quest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of fuel, or light, or barely survive a leviathan attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return back to your home, battered and bruised.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy new ship parts, upgrade your fuel supplies, craft new armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set sail again, ready to push the boundaries of the enveloping darkness, just a little bit further this time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every island has a unique story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new islands with rich stories and intertwined fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930770/extras/6165a87ee987df260089dcd6090243cf.poster.avif?t=1755118721\" width=1274 height=860 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930770/extras/6165a87ee987df260089dcd6090243cf.webm?t=1755118721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930770/extras/6165a87ee987df260089dcd6090243cf.mp4?t=1755118721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop your character</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up more than 12 unique skills, all of which have close symbiotic relationships, and will assist you in venturing out further in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930770/extras/e3f50c359f67018a315d42c6783b8c19.poster.avif?t=1755118721\" width=652 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930770/extras/e3f50c359f67018a315d42c6783b8c19.webm?t=1755118721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930770/extras/e3f50c359f67018a315d42c6783b8c19.mp4?t=1755118721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Equip more than 20 armor slots to your character.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every stat matters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930770/extras/f1464b71d085fc893982b3f018303418.poster.avif?t=1755118721\" width=1274 height=860 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930770/extras/f1464b71d085fc893982b3f018303418.webm?t=1755118721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3930770/extras/f1464b71d085fc893982b3f018303418.mp4?t=1755118721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930770?t=1755118721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3930770?t=1755118721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akama